cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "gbc: Generative Bayesian Computation"
abstract: >-
  Python package for Generative Bayesian Computation: Bayesian inference by
  training an Implicit Quantile Network on prior-predictive simulations, so
  posterior quantiles for an observed dataset come from a single forward pass
  rather than from a Markov chain. Includes the extreme-value modules and the
  reproduction bundle for the Winter Simulation Conference 2026 paper.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.5.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/VadimSokolov/gbc"
authors:
